    {
      "source": "Creates a <a href=\"../../../../relational/core/conversion/RelationalConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.conversion\"><code>RelationalConverter</code></a> using the configured\n<a href=\"../../../repository/config/AbstractJdbcConfiguration.html#jdbcMappingContext(java.util.Optional,org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert.JdbcCustomConversions,org.springframework.data.relational.RelationalManagedTypes)\"><code>AbstractJdbcConfiguration.jdbcMappingContext(Optional, JdbcCustomConversions, RelationalManagedTypes)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用配置的 <a href=\"../../../repository/config/AbstractJdbcConfiguration.html#jdbcMappingContext(java.util.Optional,org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert.JdbcCustomConversions,org.springframework.data.relational.RelationalManagedTypes)\"><code>AbstractJdbcConfiguration.jdbcMappingContext(Optional, JdbcCustomConversions, RelationalManagedTypes)</code></a> 创建一个 <a href=\"../../../../relational/core/conversion/RelationalConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.conversion\"><code>RelationalConverter</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Abstraction for accesses to the database that should be implementable with a single SQL statement per method and\nrelates to a single entity as opposed to <a href=\"../../JdbcAggregateOperations.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core\"><code>JdbcAggregateOperations</code></a> which provides interactions related to\ncomplete aggregates.",
      "translation": "对数据库访问的抽象，每个方法应能通过单个 SQL 语句实现，且针对单一实体；这与 <a href=\"../../JdbcAggregateOperations.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core\"><code>JdbcAggregateOperations</code></a> 不同，后者提供与完整聚合相关的交互。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Delegates each method to the <a href=\"../DataAccessStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>DataAccessStrategy</code></a>s passed to the constructor in turn until the first that does\nnot throw an exception.",
      "translation": "委托每个方法给按顺序传递给构造器的<a href=\"../DataAccessStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>DataAccessStrategy</code></a>，直到遇到第一个不抛出异常的策略为止。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The default <a href=\"../DataAccessStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>DataAccessStrategy</code></a> is to generate SQL statements based on metadata from the entity.",
      "translation": "默认情况下，<a href=\"../DataAccessStrategy.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert 中的接口\"><code>DataAccessStrategy</code></a> 会根据实体的元数据生成 SQL 语句。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
